/-- **`ν Catalan.RhombicTriacontahedron.polyhedron` is the largest scale of the roots of its system**, each of which has exactly one root: the list form of `catalanRhombicTriacontahedron_nu_roots`. -/
theorem catalanRhombicTriacontahedron_nu_roots_list :
    PolynomialSystem.IsRootMax [catalanRhombicTriacontahedron_nu_system_0] Catalan.RhombicTriacontahedron.polyhedron.nieuwland :=
  PolynomialSystem.IsMaxSingle.isRootMax_of_one_var catalanRhombicTriacontahedron_exact_list.1 (by decide) (by decide +kernel)

/-- **System 0 of `ν Catalan.RhombicTriacontahedron.polyhedron` has exactly one root**: one real point with every variable in its interval solves its equations. -/
theorem catalanRhombicTriacontahedron_nu_system_0_oneRoot : catalanRhombicTriacontahedron_nu_system_0.HasUniqueRoot :=
